+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus manifest says that the files were fetched through
+`raw.githubusercontent.com`.
+
+The repository does not retain a fetch log or configuration that records the
+per-domain limit actually encountered. Consequently, the number of visits per
+window, the window length, and the cooldown after a breach cannot be determined
+from this checkout. They are intentionally left undocumented rather than
+inferred from a provider's advertised limits.
+
+No evidence of any other CDN or mirror host used for this corpus was found in
+the repository.
